sequenceDiagram
  participant Drv as molt driver
  participant Src as odc-video-source
  participant Cmp as rtsp.compressor
  participant Mon as odc-rtsp-monitor

  Drv->>Cmp: apply video-only fixture + local binding
  Drv->>Src: publish rtsp://127.0.0.1:8554/stream
  Drv->>Cmp: start rtsp_lab
  Src-->>Cmp: ingest H264/H265 source
  Cmp-->>Mon: republish :8555/stream
  Mon-->>Drv: bandwidth greater than 0
  Note over Cmp: no vpn tunnel / mav / cellular
  Drv->>Cmp: stop restart + port conflict cases
